## Tips

- Shine your flashlight on the Stalker to slow it down.
- Sprinting is loud. Walk when you think something is nearby.
- Grab batteries early. A dead flashlight leaves you blind in the dark wings.
- Do not trust the map for long. Check the **M** screen often.
- Use `X` to spin around quickly when you are chased.

---

## Tech stack

- **Rendering:** Three.js r128 (WebGL)
- **UI:** Tailwind CSS (CDN) and Font Awesome icons
- **Audio:** Web Audio API (all sounds are generated in code)
- **Textures:** drawn at runtime on HTML canvases, so there are no image assets
- **Fonts:** Cinzel, Special Elite and Courier Prime from Google Fonts

The whole game is one self-contained HTML file.

