## Known issues

- Requires a desktop browser with WebGL and a keyboard. Touch controls are not supported.
- In sandboxed or embedded previews, the browser may block mouse capture or withhold keyboard focus. Open the file in its own tab, or click the game once, to fix this.
- Performance depends on your GPU. If it feels slow, close other tabs or lower your browser's zoom level.

